WEBVTT

00:11:58.662 --> 00:12:03.287
And you're more likely to hurt
someone's feelings by not asking

00:12:03.287 --> 00:12:04.662
or assuming

00:12:04.662 --> 00:12:06.329
than you are by asking.

00:12:07.329 --> 00:12:10.746
And the words that a person
uses might change.

00:12:11.079 --> 00:12:14.537
So just commit to asking and learning.

00:12:15.204 --> 00:12:17.787
Language is a powerful tool

00:12:17.787 --> 00:12:21.454
for explaining and claiming
our own identities

00:12:21.454 --> 00:12:25.079
and for building relationships
that affirm and support us.

00:12:26.079 --> 00:12:29.246
But language is just that, a tool.

00:12:29.287 --> 00:12:31.246
Language works for us,